{"role": "assistant", "content": "你可以使用element-ui的`<el-loading>`标签添加加载效果。在消息发送过程中显示加载效果，发送完成后隐藏。以下是修改后的代码：

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Vue Chat</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/element-ui/2.15.6/theme-chalk/index.css">
    <script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/vue/2.6.14/vue.min.js"></script>
    <script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/axios/0.23.0/axios.min.js"></script>
    <script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/element-ui/2.15.6/index.js"></script>
    <style>
        // 添加的样式
        .el-loading-mask {
            background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <div id="app">
        <el-container class="chat-container">
            <el-main class="chat">
                <div class="chat-main">
                    <el-timeline>
                        <template v-for="msg in activeChatRecord">
                            <el-timeline-item :timestamp="msg.time">
                                <div v-if="!msg.isLoading" class="message-card">
                                    <strong>{{ msg.user }}:</strong> {{ msg.content }}
                                </div>
                                <!-- 添加的加载效果 -->
                                <template v-else>
                                    <el-loading text="发送中..."></el-loading>
                                </template>
                            </el-timeline-item>
                        </template>
                    </el-timeline>
                </div>
                <el-input type="textarea" v-model="input"></el-input>
                <el-button type="primary" @click="sendMessage">发送</el-button>
            </el-main>
        </el-container>
    </div>
    <script>
        new Vue({
            el: '#app',
            data() {
                return {
                    input: '',
                    activeUser: '1',
                    users: [
                        { id: '1', name: '用户1' },
                        { id: '2', name: '用户2' },
                        { id: '3', name: '用户3' }
                    ],
                    chatRecord: {
                        1: [{ user: '用户1', content: '你好', time: '2021-01-01 10:30' }],
                        2: [{ user: '用户2', content: '你好', time: '2021-01-01 10:30' }],
                    },
                };
            },
            computed: {
                activeChatRecord() {
                    return this.chatRecord[this.activeUser] || [];
                },
            },
            methods: {
                handleChangeUser(activeIndex) {
                    this.activeUser = activeIndex;
                },
                async sendMessage() {
                    if (!this.input) return;

                    const message = {
                        user: '我',
                        content: this.input,
                        time: new Date().toLocaleTimeString(),
                        isLoading: true, // 添加加载状态
                    };
                    this.activeChatRecord.push(message);
                    this.input = '';

                    // 模拟延迟2秒发送消息
                    await new Promise((resolve) => setTimeout(resolve, 2000));

                    message.isLoading = false; // 发送完成，隐藏加载效果
                },
            },
        });
    </script>
</body>

</html>
```

上面的代码在发送消息过程中，显示了一个带有加载效果的时间轴标签(增加了`isLoading`状态)，发送完成后，隐藏了这个效果。同时，添加了`el-loading-mask`的样式覆盖默认的背景样式。"},
