0 ≤ nums length ≤ 106
0 ≤ nums[i] ≤ 106
0 ≤ target ≤ 106
Examples
Example 1
const nums = [6, 4, 2, 3, 8];
const target = 13;
pairSumOrLess(nums, target); // => [4, 8]
